 "plot": [
  "Front: 6 m garden, crazy-paving path, overgrown privet hedge 1.6 m both sides",
  "Back & side: WALLED VEGETABLE GARDEN 14 x 12 m (BrickRed wall 1.8 m): raised beds (VegBeds) of cabbages, bean canes, marrows gone to seed; a scarecrow-like coat on a pole; compost bins (CompostBags); wheelbarrow; a cold frame"
 ],
 "puzzle": [
  "LOCK FIRST: going down the cellar stair the beam of the flashlight lands on the steel lockbox with 4 dials.",
  "The cellar is DARK: reset the fuse box (hold interact 2 s, small noise) - DESIGN Rao.",
  "Read the chalk WRITING ON THE WALL: which photos count ('the ones on the mantel, the stairs and the wedding, in that order').",
  "Each digit = number of people in that photo AS IT WAS BY DAY. At night the photos have extra people (night change) - players must remember, or have photographed them by day (DESIGN Rao twist).",
  "Wrong code = clunk; 3 wrong codes in a row trips the fuse again.",
  "Part: Family seal ring, in a velvet pouch in the lockbox."
 ],
